    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see what you did there with the \"whispers\" and \"dancing,\" but it's starting to feel a bit circular. It's like we're circling the same ideas just to add more adjectives. \n\nThe score is still sitting in the \"low-substance\" range because the word count hasn't really hit the threshold for a Tier 2 quest. I know I said don't pad it, but if we can't get that number up, the system is just going to flag this as a \"low-effort\" asset. \n\nCan you try one more time? Just give it more weight. Talk about the history of the forest, the feeling of the air, the relics, the gods, whatever. Just... make it longer and more immersive. Avoid just saying the same thing three different ways, please, but we really need to see that word count climb.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
